	"A SONG IN THE RAIN": "雨中的歌",
	"WESTERN PIER": "西侧码头",
	"THE WATER IS FLOWING": "水流重新连通",
	"SAIL TO RAINSTEP FROM THE WESTERN PIER": "到西侧码头，乘船前往雨阶岛",
	"MEET ORLA BY THE RAINSTEP LANDING": "到雨阶岛渡口，与奥菈交谈",
	"RETURN TO ORLA WITH THE WATER FLOWING": "水路已连通，回去告诉奥菈",
	"RAINSTEP FLOWS AGAIN": "雨阶岛的水声再次响起",
	"MEET NERI BY THE NORTHERN WATER CHANNEL": "前往北侧水渠与奈里交谈",
	"CHALLENGE ILYA AT THE SECOND LIGHT BEACON": "前往第二航灯挑战伊莱亚",
	"TWO LIGHTS NOW GUIDE THE SEA-LANES": "两盏航灯照亮海上归途",
	"YOUR COMPANIONS KNOW HOW TO LISTEN TO EACH OTHER. ILYA IS WAITING AT THE BEACON AT THE END OF THE NORTHERN PATH.": "你的伙伴已经懂得彼此倾听。沿北侧小路走到尽头，伊莱亚正在航灯旁等你。",
	"FIRST HELP THE WATER FIND ITS WAY THROUGH ALL THREE CHANNELS, THEN REPORT TO ORLA. A SHARED LIGHT BEGINS WITH WORK THAT HELPS SOMEONE ELSE.": "先疏通三处水路，再向奥菈报个平安。愿意为别人出一份力，才有大家共享的灯火。",
	"THE CHANNELS ARE SINGING AGAIN. LET US SEE HOW YOUR COMPANIONS ANSWER ONE ANOTHER. I WILL REST YOUR TEAM BEFORE WE BEGIN.": "水渠又唱起歌了。让我听听你的伙伴如何互相应和。开始前，先让大家休息一下。",
	"MY RILLISK MOVES QUICKLY; MY TERRACURL STANDS FIRM. A PLAIN STRIKE IS USEFUL WHEN AN ELEMENT IS RESISTED.": "我的檐溪蜥行动敏捷，阶纹蜗稳如磐石。属性受到抵抗时，不妨试试普通的轻击。",
	"THIS BEACON ASKS FOR TWO THINGS: BRING THE RAIN BACK TO THE GARDENS, AND LEARN TO LISTEN IN NERI'S CHANNEL CHALLENGE.": "这盏航灯有两个愿望：让雨水重回菜圃，并在奈里的水渠挑战中学会倾听。",
	"REPORT THE WATERWORKS TO ORLA, THEN MEET NERI ON THE NORTHERN CROSSING. I WILL BE HERE WHEN YOU ARE READY.": "先向奥菈报告水路已经修好，再去北侧岔路见奈里。准备好后，我会在这里等你。",
	"A LIGHT CARRIED ALONE IS A SPARK. A LIGHT SHARED ACROSS THE SEA BECOMES A PROMISE.": "独自捧着的光，是一点火花。越过海面与人分享的光，便成了一份约定。",
	"YOUR TEAM MAY REST HERE. FACE MY TERRACURL, RILLISK, AND GLIMVEIL; USE YOUR WHOLE PARTY, AND TAKE TIME TO RECOVER WHEN YOU NEED IT.": "让伙伴们在这里歇一歇。接下来面对我的阶纹蜗、檐溪蜥与灯纱蝠吧。发挥全队的力量，需要时就恢复体力。",
	"YOU GAVE EVERY VOICE ITS MOMENT. TAKE THESE SUPPLIES, AND FOLLOW THE CENTRAL PATH NORTH TO ILYA'S BEACON.": "你给每个声音都留出了机会。收下这些补给，沿中央小路向北，去伊莱亚的航灯吧。",
	"THE SECOND LIGHT TRIAL HAS THREE COMPANIONS. SWITCH WHEN A MATCHUP IS DIFFICULT, AND LET ORLA HELP WHENEVER YOU NEED A REST.": "第二航灯试炼有三位对手。遇到难以应对的属性就换位，需要休息时，随时去找奥菈。",
	"LISTEN. THE WATER BELOW AND THE LIGHT ABOVE ARE ANSWERING EACH OTHER. RAINSTEP HAS FOUND ITS VOICE AGAIN.": "听，脚下的流水与头顶的灯光正在彼此应和。雨阶岛又找回了自己的声音。",
	"TAKE THE SECOND LIGHT CREST. TONIGHT, OUR BEACON AND WAKEHARBOR'S LAMP WILL DRAW A PATH ACROSS THE MIST.": "收下第二航灯徽章吧。今夜，我们的航灯和醒潮港的灯火，会在雾中连成一条归途。",
	"TWO ISLANDS, TWO LIGHTS, AND ALL THE SMALL COMPANIONS WHO CARRIED US HERE. LET THE NEXT TRAVELLER FIND A BRIGHTER SHORE.": "两座岛，两盏灯，还有一路陪我们走来的小小伙伴。愿下一位旅人，遇见更明亮的海岸。",
	"THE FIRST LIGHT HAS OPENED THE SEA-LANE. MY FERRY CAN TAKE YOU TO RAINSTEP, WHERE THE ROOF GUTTERS HAVE FALLEN QUIET.": "第一盏灯照亮了航路。我可以载你去雨阶岛，那里的檐沟已经很久没有水声了。",
	"THE SEA-LANE IS STILL HIDDEN. LIGHT THE FIRST LIGHT TOWER BEFORE WE SAIL.": "航路仍藏在雾中。先点亮初光灯塔，我们才能出发。",
	"THE FERRY IS READY WHENEVER YOU WANT TO RETURN TO WAKEHARBOR.": "想回醒潮港时，随时来找我，渡船一直在这里等你。",
	"A QUIET CROSSING BRINGS YOU SAFELY TO THE OTHER ISLAND.": "渡船安静地穿过水面，平安将你送到了另一座岛。",
	"FOLLOW THE DRY PATHS. ORLA OFFERS FREE REST BY THE LANDING, AND VENN CAN ALWAYS TAKE YOU HOME.": "沿干燥的小路前行。渡口边的奥菈会免费提供休息，维恩随时都能送你回家。",
	"I BROUGHT EVERYONE BACK TO THE LANDING. YOUR COMPANIONS ARE RESTED, AND YOUR PROGRESS IS SAFE.": "我把大家带回了渡口。伙伴们已经休息好了，旅程进度也都还在。",
	"YOUR COMPANIONS NEED REST. ORLA BRINGS YOU TO THE LANDING.": "伙伴们需要休息，奥菈将你带回了渡口。",
	"THREE CHANNELS CARRY ROOF WATER TO THE GARDENS. REPAIR THEM IN ANY ORDER, THEN RETURN TO ORLA.": "三处水槽将屋檐的雨水引向菜圃。按任意顺序修好它们，再回来找奥菈。",
	"REACH RAINSTEP BY FERRY AFTER EARNING THE LANTERN SIGIL.": "获得初光徽章后，再乘渡船前往雨阶岛。",
	"RAIN TAPS THE ROOFS AND GATHERS IN THE STONE CHANNELS.": "雨点轻敲屋顶，沿着石槽汇成细流。",
	"FROM ROOF TO BRIDGE TO GARDEN, RAINSTEP'S WATER IS MOVING AGAIN.": "从屋檐、木桥到菜圃，雨阶岛的水又流起来了。",
	"YOUR COMPANIONS ARE RESTED. THE LANDING HAS SUPPLIES WHENEVER YOU NEED THEM.": "伙伴们已经休息好了。需要补给时，随时回渡口来。",
	"THE GARDEN POOLS ARE FILLING. THANK YOU FOR GIVING THE RAIN A CLEAR PATH.": "菜圃的蓄水池又有水了。谢谢你为雨水疏通了去路。",
	"FOLLOW THE CHANNELS UPHILL. EACH REPAIR HELPS WATER REACH THE GARDENS.": "顺着水槽向坡上走。每修好一处，雨水就离菜圃更近一步。",
	"WELCOME TO RAINSTEP. I AM ORLA, THE KEEPER OF THIS LANDING.": "欢迎来到雨阶岛。我叫奥菈，照看着这处渡口。",
	"RAIN FEEDS OUR ROOF INTAKE, BRIDGE JUNCTION, AND GARDEN OUTLET, BUT ALL THREE NEED A CAREFUL REPAIR.": "雨水依次流过屋檐引水口、桥边接水槽和菜圃出水口，可三处都需要仔细修理。",
	"CLEAR THE ROOF GRATE, ALIGN THE BRIDGE TROUGH, AND OPEN THE GARDEN GATE IN ANY ORDER. NO SUPPLIES ARE NEEDED.": "清理屋檐滤网、对齐桥边水槽、打开菜圃水闸，按什么顺序都行，也不需要消耗物资。",
	"THE CLEAR ROOF GRATE CATCHES RAIN WITHOUT CATCHING LEAVES.": "干净的屋檐滤网让雨水流进槽里，将落叶挡在外面。",
	"THE BRIDGE TROUGH CARRIES A STEADY STREAM ACROSS THE GAP.": "桥边的水槽承着一线稳稳的流水，接通了断口。",
	"THE OPEN GARDEN GATE LETS WATER SETTLE AMONG THE ROOTS.": "敞开的菜圃水闸让水缓缓浸润根边的泥土。",
	"YOU LIFT THE FALLEN LEAVES FROM THE ROOF GRATE. RAIN SLIPS INTO THE UPPER CHANNEL.": "你捡去屋檐滤网上的落叶，雨水顺畅地流入上方的水槽。",
	"YOU TURN THE LOOSE TROUGH INTO PLACE BENEATH THE BRIDGE. ITS STREAM CROSSES THE GAP.": "你将桥下松动的水槽转回原位，一线流水接通了断口。",
	"YOU EASE THE STUCK GARDEN GATE OPEN. WATER SPREADS GENTLY THROUGH THE PLANTING BEDS.": "你缓缓推开卡住的菜圃水闸，水流轻轻漫入种植畦。",
	"ALL THREE CHANNELS ARE CLEAR. THE RAIN HAS A PATH FROM THE ROOFS TO THE GARDENS.": "三处水槽都畅通了，雨水终于能从屋檐一路流到菜圃。",
	"RETURN TO ORLA AT THE LANDING AND SHARE THE GOOD NEWS.": "回渡口找奥菈，告诉她这个好消息吧。",
	"MIRA": "米拉",
	"IVO": "伊沃",
	"EDDA": "艾妲",
	"SOREN": "索伦",
	"YOUR JOURNEY": "你的旅程",
	"CHOOSE A COMPANION": "选择一位伙伴",
	"CATCH A WILD RESONANT": "捕获一位野生共鸣兽",
	"DEFEAT IVO": "战胜伊沃",
	"WIN THE FIRST LIGHT": "赢得初光试炼",
	"DEFEAT NERI": "战胜奈里",
	"WIN THE SECOND LIGHT": "赢得第二航灯试炼",
	"PATHS ARE SAFE. WALK INTO THE REEDS TO MEET A WILD RESONANT. MIRA OFFERS FREE REST AND SUPPLIES IN THE VILLAGE.": "石径上很安全。走入芦苇，便能遇见野生共鸣兽。村里的米拉会免费提供休息和补给。",
	"A COMFORTABLE JOURNEY": "自在的旅程",
	"SAVE JOURNEY NOW": "立即保存旅程",
	"SOUND: OFF": "声音：关",
	"SOUND: ON": "声音：开",
	"SOUND OFF": "声音已关闭",
	"SOUND ON": "声音已开启",
	"SOFT FOCUS: OFF": "柔光：关",
	"SOFT FOCUS: ON": "柔光：开",
	"LANGUAGE: ENGLISH": "语言：英语",
	"LANGUAGE: SIMPLIFIED CHINESE": "语言：简体中文",
	"CONTROLS": "操作方式",
	"WASD / ARROWS    WALK": "WASD / 方向键    移动",
	"SHIFT           RUN": "SHIFT           奔跑",
	"E / ENTER       TALK & CONFIRM": "E / 回车        交谈与确认",
	"TAB / ESC       SATCHEL & BACK": "TAB / ESC       行囊与返回",
	"J / P           JOURNAL / PARTY": "J / P           图鉴 / 伙伴",
	"1-7             BATTLE ACTION": "1-7             战斗行动",
	"M / F11         MUTE / FULLSCREEN": "M / F11         静音 / 全屏",
	"F5              QUICK SAVE": "F5              快速保存",
	"YOUR JOURNEY SAVES AFTER MILESTONES AND WHILE EXPLORING. CLOSING DURING A BATTLE RETURNS TO THE LAST SAFE SAVE.": "完成重要进展或探索时会自动保存。战斗中关闭游戏，下次将回到最近的安全存档。",
	"ORIGINAL CODE ART / ORIGINAL SYNTH SCORE / GODOT 4.7.2": "原创代码美术 / 原创合成配乐 / GODOT 4.7.2",
	"THE FIRST LIGHT": "第一盏灯",
	"THE SECOND LIGHT": "第二盏航灯",
	"TWO SEA-LANES SHINE AGAIN.": "两条航路重新闪耀。",
	"TWO LIGHTS, ONE SHARED HORIZON.": "两盏灯火，同一片远方。",
	"LANTERNWAKE / END OF CHAPTER II": "灯潮纪 / 第二章结束",
	"A SEA-LANE SHINES AGAIN.": "一条航道，再次亮起。",
	"A SMALL JOURNEY. A REAL DIFFERENCE.": "小小的旅程，也能带来改变。",
	"RETURN TO THE ISLAND": "回到小岛",
	"LANTERNWAKE  /  END OF CHAPTER I": "灯潮纪 / 第一章完",
	"YOUR LEAD COMPANION IS READY.": "领队伙伴已经准备好了。",
	"KEEP AT LEAST ONE COMPANION WITH YOU.": "请至少留一位伙伴与你同行。",
	"RELEASED TO ITS HOME REGION. JOURNAL ENTRY KEPT.": "伙伴已回到原栖息地，图鉴记录仍然保留。",
	"THE FIRST LIGHT IS YOURS. THE MEADOW IS STILL ALIVE.": "你已赢得初光。烛苇原依旧生机盎然。",
	"TWO LIGHTS ARE YOURS. RAINSTEP IS ALIVE WITH SONG.": "两盏航灯已亮起。雨阶岛正回响着歌声。",
	"TWO ISLANDS  /  TWO LIGHTS": "双岛旅程  /  两盏航灯",
	"TWO SMALL ISLANDS. SONGS ACROSS THE SEA.": "两座小岛，隔海相和的歌声。",
	"WALK TO A PERSON OR SIGN, THEN PRESS E.": "走近人物或路牌，再按 E 互动。",
	"JOURNEY SAVED.": "旅程已保存。",
	"COULD NOT SAVE. CHECK DISK PERMISSIONS.": "保存失败，请检查磁盘权限。",
	"COULD NOT SAVE LANGUAGE PREFERENCE.": "语言偏好保存失败。",
	"EDDA / LANTERN KEEPER": "艾妲 / 守灯人",
	"EDDA / THE LANTERN KEEPER": "艾妲 / 守灯人",
	"EDDA / A SMALL BEGINNING": "艾妲 / 小小的开始",
	"MIRA / REST & SUPPLIES": "米拉 / 休息与补给",
	"IVO / BRIDGE CHALLENGER": "伊沃 / 桥边挑战者",
	"SOREN / FIRST LIGHT GYM": "索伦 / 初光灯塔",
	"CANDLE REED / FIELD NOTES": "烛苇原 / 野外须知",
	"A TRAVELLER'S CACHE": "旅人的补给箱",
	"SOREN / THE FIRST LIGHT": "索伦 / 第一盏灯",
	"IVO / A PROMISE KEPT": "伊沃 / 信守约定",
	"MIRA / TRY AGAIN": "米拉 / 再次出发",
	"EVERY ISLAND HAS A SONG. OURS HAS BEEN QUIET SINCE THE GREAT MIST SWALLOWED THE SEA-LANES.": "每座岛都有自己的歌。大雾吞没航道后，我们的岛便沉寂了。",
	"BUT THE LITTLE CREATURES STILL REMEMBER. WE CALL THEM RESONANTS. THEY CARRY A SPARK OF THE OLD SONG.": "但这些小生灵还记得。我们叫它们共鸣兽，它们守着旧日歌声的一点火光。",
	"FIND A COMPANION. LISTEN TO THE MEADOW. THEN BRING YOUR OWN LIGHT TO SOREN'S LIGHTHOUSE.": "找一位伙伴，听听原野的声音。然后带着你的光，去索伦的灯塔吧。",
	"TAKE 12 ECHO VESSELS AND 5 TONICS. CROSS THE WOODEN BRIDGE, THEN STEP OFF THE STONE PATH INTO THE REEDS.": "带上12个回声瓶和5瓶药剂。穿过木桥，离开石径，走进芦苇丛。",
	"WEAKEN A WILD RESONANT, THEN USE CAPTURE. YOUR FIRST CATCH IS CERTAIN BELOW HALF HEALTH. MIRA CAN HEAL AND REFILL SUPPLIES FOR FREE.": "削弱野生共鸣兽后使用捕获。首次捕获时，体力降至一半就能成功。米拉会免费治疗并补充物资。",
	"THE LIGHTHOUSE IS NO PLACE FOR A LONELY HERO. CATCH A FRIEND IN CANDLE REED, MEET IVO AT THE BRIDGE, AND LISTEN TO WHAT SOREN HAS TO SAY.": "去灯塔可别孤身逞强。先在烛苇原结识伙伴，再去桥边见伊沃，听听索伦的叮嘱。",
	"EMBER WARMS GROVE. GROVE DRINKS TIDE. TIDE COOLS EMBER. A PLAIN STRIKE IS USEFUL WHEN YOUR OWN ELEMENT IS RESISTED.": "余烬克制林地，林地克制潮汐，潮汐克制余烬。属性受抵抗时，不妨试试普通的轻击。",
	"A WARM MEAL, A LITTLE QUIET, AND YOU'RE READY AGAIN. YOUR PARTY IS FULLY RESTED. VESSELS AND TONICS HAVE BEEN REFILLED.": "吃顿热饭，安静歇一会儿，就又能出发了。伙伴们已完全恢复，回声瓶和药剂也补齐了。",
	"COME BACK WHENEVER YOU NEED. A JOURNEY SHOULD TEST YOUR COURAGE, NOT YOUR PURSE.": "有需要就回来。旅程该考验的是勇气，而不是钱袋。",
	"YOUR COMPANIONS ARE SINGING IN TIME NOW. SOREN IS WAITING BY THE LIGHTHOUSE TO THE NORTH. I'LL KEEP THE BRIDGE LIT.": "你和伙伴的歌声已经合拍了。索伦在北边的灯塔等你，我会守好桥上的灯。",
	"CATCH ONE WILD RESONANT FIRST! STEP INTO THE REEDS BESIDE THIS PATH. WEAKEN IT WITH STRIKE, THEN THROW AN ECHO VESSEL.": "先结识一位野生共鸣兽吧！走进路旁的芦苇，用轻击削弱它，再投出回声瓶。",
	"TWO SPARKS ALREADY? THEN LET'S SEE HOW THEY MOVE TOGETHER. I'LL GIVE YOUR TEAM A QUICK REST BEFORE WE BEGIN.": "已经有两点火光了？让我看看你们配合得如何。开始前，先让伙伴们休息一下。",
	"LOOK BEYOND THE MIST. THAT IS A SEA-LANE, SHINING AGAIN. THE FIRST LIGHT CREST BELONGS TO YOU.": "看看雾的那一边。一条航道又亮起来了。初光徽章属于你。",
	"THREE NEW RESONANTS SHELTER BY RAINSTEP'S CHANNELS, WARM STONES, AND ROOF EAVES. LOOK AMONG THE PALE PLANTS, THEN WEAKEN THEM BEFORE CAPTURE.": "三种新的共鸣兽栖身在雨阶岛的水槽、暖石与屋檐旁。到浅色草丛中找找，捕获前记得先削弱它们。",
	"THE FIRST LIGHT TRIAL ASKS FOR TRUST AND PRACTICE. BEFRIEND ONE WILD RESONANT, THEN EARN IVO'S RESPECT AT THE BRIDGE.": "初光试炼需要信任和历练。先结识一位野生共鸣兽，再到桥边赢得伊沃的认可。",
	"RETURN WITH THOSE TWO EXPERIENCES, AND WE WILL WAKE THIS TOWER TOGETHER.": "带着这两段经历回来，我们一起唤醒这座灯塔。",
	"THE FIRST LIGHT IS NOT A FLAME. IT IS THE CHOICE TO CARE FOR SOMETHING SMALLER THAN YOURSELF.": "第一盏灯，不只是一簇火焰。它是你愿意照顾弱小生灵的心意。",
	"YOUR COMPANIONS MAY REST HERE. WHEN YOU ARE READY, FACE MY VOLTKITE AND NOCTULUME. LET US HEAR YOUR SONG.": "让伙伴们在这里歇一歇。准备好后，就来面对我的霆风鳐和夜辉鸮。让我们听听你的歌。",
	"CANDLE REED FIELD NOTES: WILD RESONANTS HIDE AWAY FROM THE STONE PATHS. THEIR OUTLINES STIR WHERE THE GRASS GROWS TALL.": "烛苇原野外须知：野生共鸣兽藏在石径之外，高草摇曳处，常能发现它们的身影。",
	"CAPTURE IS CERTAIN AT ONE-QUARTER HEALTH; YOUR VERY FIRST CATCH NEEDS ONLY HALF HEALTH. STRIKE IS GENTLER THAN A SIGNATURE MOVE.": "体力降至四分之一即可保证捕获；首次捕获只需降至一半。轻击比绝招温和，更适合削弱目标。",
	"P OPENS YOUR PARTY. J OPENS THE JOURNAL. SET A NEW LEAD TO TRAIN ANOTHER FRIEND. A FULL PARTY CAN RELEASE A COMPANION WHILE KEEPING ITS JOURNAL ENTRY.": "按 P 查看伙伴，按 J 打开图鉴。更换领队可培养其他伙伴。队伍满员时可放归伙伴，图鉴记录仍会保留。",
	"AN EMPTY BOX. BENEATH THE LID: 'LEAVE A LITTLE LIGHT FOR THE NEXT TRAVELLER.'": "箱子空了。盖子内侧写着：“给下一位旅人留一点光。”",
	"YOU FOUND 4 ECHO VESSELS AND 2 TONICS! A NOTE READS: 'FOR WHOEVER CHOOSES THE LONGER ROAD.'": "找到了4个回声瓶和2瓶药剂！纸条上写着：“送给愿意走远路的人。”",
	"THERE IT IS. NOT THE LOUDEST SONG, BUT ONE THAT KNOWS WHEN TO LISTEN. THE TOWER REMEMBERS.": "听见了。这首歌并不响亮，却懂得何时倾听。灯塔也记起来了。",
	"TAKE THE FIRST LIGHT CREST. TONIGHT, A FISHING BOAT WILL FIND ITS WAY HOME BECAUSE YOU AND YOUR COMPANIONS CAME HERE.": "收下初光徽章吧。因为你和伙伴来到这里，今夜会有一艘渔船循着灯火平安归家。",
	"THE MIST IS WIDE. BUT SO IS THE WORLD BEYOND IT. LET THIS BE THE FIRST SMALL LIGHT OF MANY.": "大雾辽阔，雾外的世界也同样辽阔。愿这盏小灯，成为无数灯火的开始。",
	"THAT WAS A REAL SONG! TAKE THESE SUPPLIES. THE STONE PATH NORTH LEADS TO THE FIRST LIGHT SANCTUM.": "真是一首好歌！收下这些补给吧。沿着石径向北，就能到初光灯塔。",
	"SOREN HAS TWO COMPANIONS. BRING A FRIEND, USE TONICS WHEN YOU NEED THEM, AND DON'T FORGET YOU CAN SWITCH.": "索伦有两位伙伴。带上朋友，需要时记得用药剂，也别忘了可以换位。",
	"I FOUND YOU ON THE PATH. EVERYONE IS SAFE AND RESTED, AND I PACKED A FEW SPARE SUPPLIES. NOTHING IMPORTANT WAS LOST.": "我在路上找到了你。大家都很安全，也休息好了。我还装了些备用物资。重要的东西都还在。",
